Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:55:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: OnePlus 8 Pro panel and
 sensor devinfo fixes

Add kernel patches 0115 (power the panel off again when the DSC picture
parameter set cannot be sent) and 0116 (keep the SAR channel count
inside the feature array).
---
 ...g-ams678uw01-power-off-when-the-PPS-.patch | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...-sensor-devinfo-bound-the-SAR-channe.patch | 33 ++++++++++++
